pps/2256280/extras/bd9f93e6ef25832f8da39ac9d0516c92.mp4?t=1754477722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A word from the developer...</h2>Not enough lady-meat in your RPGs?<br><br>Project Skyward is a love-letter to classic JRPGs and the futanari fandom. It is a story about an air-headed futa adventurer who is thrust into a realm at war. As an aspiring hero, you'll be expected to rise and meet the coming threat. All the quest-giving MILFs are counting on you after all...<br><br>Unsheathe your blade! <br>Journey to slay the evil Demon Queen Eraanthe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2256280/extras/61ceaf9775e91b9cb3ad7e85b49b29ca.avif?t=1754477722\" /></span>",
